  - m_Id: 81329197903872
    m_Localized: 'Finish your errands before time runs out!

      

      Move: WASD / Arrow keys

      Talk / Interact: E

      Switch errand: Tab

      Inventory: I

      Pause: Esc

      

      Find the mode spot in town to start:

      Story: get through each day, one errand at a time.

      Classic: clear as many errands as you can for a high score.'
